@startuml architecture
!pragma layout smetana
title M3a runtime responsibilities (one console process)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
component "Host\ncreates dependencies" as Host
component "Core\nInspectionEngine" as Engine
component "Core\nInspectionRunner" as Core
component "Infrastructure\nSimulatedDevice" as Device
component "Infrastructure\nRangeInspector" as Inspector
component "Interop\nNativeInspector" as Native
component "NativeInspection.dll\nC ABI / synchronous inspection" as DLL
component "Infrastructure\nJsonResultStore" as Store
database "RunId.json" as Result
Host --> Engine : Start / GetStatus / CancelRun
Engine --> Core : one admitted run / shared persistence boundary
Host ..> Engine : await DisposeAsync before adapter disposal
Core --> Device : IDevice
Core --> Inspector : IInspector (managed)
Core --> Native : IInspector (native)
Native --> DLL : LibraryImport / SafeHandle
Host ..> Native : owns / Dispose
Core --> Store : IResultStore
Store --> Result : publish after write
note bottom of Core
Calls ports declared by Core.
No dependency on adapter assemblies.
end note
@enduml
